  WriterSettings settings = WriterSettings.newBuilder()
          .setTopicPath(topicPath)
          .setProducerId(producerAndGroupID)
          .setMessageGroupId(producerAndGroupID)
          .setCodec(Codec.ZSTD)
          .build();
  ```

